List all training jobs

Usage
  azd ai training job list [flags]

Flags
      --include-archived  : Include archived jobs in the results (default: active only)
      --properties string : Filter results by properties (comma-separated, e.g., --properties "prop1,prop2=value2")
      --skip-token string : Continuation token for next page of results
      --tag string        : Filter results by tag key (e.g., --tag team)

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string              : Sets the current working directory
      --debug                   : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string      : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help                    : help for list
      --no-prompt               : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string           : The output format (supported: table, json) (default "table")
      --project-endpoint string : Azure AI Foundry project endpoint URL (e.g., https://account.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/project-name)
  -s, --subscription string     : Azure subscription ID (enables implicit init if environment not configured)

Examples
  List active training jobs
    azd ai training job list

  Include archived jobs
    azd ai training job list --include-archived
